1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:04,420
米奇爾 你醒了嗎
Oh, Mitchell. Are you awake?

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,560
醒了 樓上的女士好像叫了一聲
Yeah, I think the lady upstairs just screamed.

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,190
-我們該去看看她嗎 -不 是我叫的
- Should we check on her? - No, that was me.

4
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,580
我剛剛淋浴時發生了很可怕的事
Something terrible just happened in the shower.

5
00:00:10,675 --> 00:00:12,535
天啊 你又亂刮什么地方的毛了
Oh, God. What did you try to shave?

6
00:00:12,535 --> 00:00:13,375
不 是我忘了
No, I forgot

7
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:15,645
《謝天謝地我是鄉下男孩》的歌詞
the words to "Thank God I'm A Country Boy."

8
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,060
好吧 兩分鐘前 我還在夢中
Okay, two minutes ago, I was on the back

9
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,660
和007丹尼爾·克雷格騎雪上摩托
of a snowmobile with Daniel Craig.

10
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,960
米奇爾 我整個童年都在唱那首歌
Mitchell, I sang that song my entire childhood.

11
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,560
假如我忘記了歌詞
If I can't remember the lyrics,

12
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,100
說明我完全忘記了自己的根
that means I've lost complete touch with my roots.

13
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,860
我怎么會讓這種事發生
How could I let this happen?

14
00:00:26,925 --> 00:00:28,445
別對自己這么嚴苛
Don't be so hard on yourself.

15
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,980
我沒有 這大部分都要怪你
I'm not. This is mostly your doing.

16
00:00:30,365 --> 00:00:31,305
我該猜到你會這么說
Should have seen that coming.

17
00:00:31,305 --> 00:00:33,225
你用羞辱趕走了我心中的鄉下男孩
You have shamed the country boy out of me.

18
00:00:33,225 --> 00:00:35,675
我一說"大伙兒"和"可勁兒"你就翻白眼
You roll your eyes when I say "y'all" or "fixin'".

19
00:00:35,675 --> 00:00:37,485
還逼我把曬衣繩丟了
You made me take down our clothesline.

20
00:00:37,485 --> 00:00:39,325
我只是叫你掛到后院去
I just asked that we put it in the backyard.

21
00:00:39,325 --> 00:00:40,796
你知道我必須怎樣做
You know what I have to do.

22
00:00:40,866 --> 00:00:43,346
-重新記歌詞 -養只雞
- Relearn the lyrics to -- - Get a chicken.

23
00:00:43,586 --> 00:00:45,816
顯然 沒有法律條文規定
So, apparently, there's no legal reason

24
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,720
我們不能在后院養雞
why we can't have a chicken in our backyard,

25
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,810
我很徹底地查過資料
and-and I did a real deep dive.

26
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:54,340
這是廚房 我們最近重裝修過
Okay, so this is the kitchen, which we recently remodeled.

27
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,840
習慣他這副臭臉
Get used to that.

28
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,280
這是客廳
Okay, this is the living room.

29
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:16,980
好了 到時你和媽坐在椅子上
Okay, so, you and Mom will be in the chairs.

30
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:20,140
我 海莉和盧克坐在沙發上
Me, Haley, and Luke will be on the couch.

31
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:22,420
面試官就坐在這
And the interviewer will be right here.

32
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:25,600
艾麗克斯正在申請一份享有聲望的政府工作
Alex is up for a very prestigious government job

33
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,780
需要進行家庭面試
that requires a family interview.

34
00:01:27,986 --> 00:01:29,886
以防他們帶了那種記憶消除器
In case they bring one of those memory zappers,

35
00:01:29,886 --> 00:01:32,467
我把所有相關信息都寫在胳膊上了
I've Sharpied all the pertinent information on my arm --

36
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:33,677
個人識別碼之類的
PIN numbers, et cetera.

37
00:01:33,677 --> 00:01:35,117
親愛的 你不是真心覺得他們會
Oh, honey, you don't think that they're really going to --

38
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:37,180
別擔心 妹子 我把你也寫上了
Oh, do not worry, little lady. I got you covered.

39
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:41,200
假如你真的想給面試官留個好印象
If you really want to impress the interviewer,

40
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,900
不如不經意地把這張我在健身房撿到的
why don't you try casually leaving out this completed

41
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:47,820
填滿的《紐約時報》填字謎放在桌上
New York Times crossword that I found at the gym?

42
00:01:48,227 --> 00:01:49,867
參加槍戰只帶把刀怎么行
Why bring a knife to a gun fight?

43
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,780
不如我把傳家寶擺出來吧
How about I lay out the family heirloom?

44
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:55,080
1931年 曾祖父泰德·鄧菲
1931. Great-grandpa Ted Dunphy

45
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:57,660
在一個霧蒙蒙的夜晚從莫德斯托驅車南下
is driving south from Modesto one foggy evening.

46
00:01:57,660 --> 00:01:59,560
他讓一個拋錨的摩托司機搭了便車
He picks up a stranded motorist

47
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,480
把他送到一間加油站
and drives him to a gas station.

48
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:04,260
那個人沒錢 所以泰德幫他付了油錢
The man has no money, so Ted pays for his gas.

49
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:07,600
那個人在餐巾紙上畫了張速寫感謝他
The man thanks him with a quick drawing on a cocktail napkin.

50
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:10,200
你瞧 那個人 是迪士尼創辦人華特·迪士尼
For you see, that man... was Walt Disney.

51
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:14,220
而這位眼熟的小伙子 就是米老鼠
And this familiar fellow is Mickey Mouse.

52
00:02:15,157 --> 00:02:17,857
不必擺出填字謎或傳家寶 二位
Yeah, no thanks on the heirloom or the crossword, guys.

53
00:02:17,857 --> 00:02:19,987
一切從簡 好嗎
Let's keep it simple, okay?

54
00:02:19,987 --> 00:02:22,538
親愛的 放松 你這么棒
Honey, relax. You're awesome.

55
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,260
肯定會很順利的
It's gonna go great.

56
00:02:24,268 --> 00:02:26,178
只要我們先把這張椅子搬回到
Just as soon as we get this chair back

57
00:02:26,178 --> 00:02:29,118
自我們住進來起就沒變過的位置
to where it's been ever since we've lived in this house.

58
00:02:29,118 --> 00:02:31,938
媽 拜托你別再控制一切了好嗎
Mom, can you please stop managing everything?

59
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,520
就像她把我的帽子收藏清理掉
You mean like when she cleaned my hat collection

60
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:35,740
以防面試官檢查衣柜時看到它們
out of the front closet in case the interviewer looked in there?

61
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:37,440
親愛的 你從不戴那些帽子
Honey, you never wore those hats,

62
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:39,300
慈善機構收下時特別開心
and the charity was glad to get them.

63
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:40,800
或許你該把我的夢想也一起捐了
Maybe you should have also donated my dream

64
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,080
例如某天去肯塔基賽馬
of one day going to the Kentucky Derby

65
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,320
或去黑人教堂過復活節[都要戴帽子]
or Easter at a black church.

66
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:46,060
艾麗克斯 小貼士 面試時記得微笑
Hey, Alex. Quick tip. Smile during the interview.

67
00:02:46,308 --> 00:02:47,238
我最近在心理課上
I've been learning a lot about

68
00:02:47,238 --> 00:02:49,108
學了不同人格類型
different personality types in my psych course,

69
00:02:49,108 --> 00:02:51,558
你算是教科書級的邊緣類型了
and you're kind of textbook borderline --

70
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:52,840
高智商 沒有共情能力
all brains, no empathy.

71
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,340
盧克 你這么努力學習
You know, Luke, we are so very proud

72
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:56,520
我們都很驕傲
of all the hard work you're doing,

73
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,460
我也很期待你學完第二章后
and I look forward to hearing your insights

74
00:02:58,460 --> 00:02:59,980
會有什么樣的見解
when you finish chapter two.

75
00:02:59,980 --> 00:03:03,000
不過目前而言 或許你可以先把書收起來
But for now, maybe you could just put that book away.

76
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,560
我就知道你會這么說
No surprise you'd say that.

77
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,120
控制狂 強迫癥
Controlling, obsessive --

78
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,360
典型的指揮官人格類型
classic Commandant personality type.

79
00:03:09,818 --> 00:03:10,678
挨損了吧
Ooh, burn.

80
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:12,100
成熟點吧 海莉
Oh, grow up, Haley.

81
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:13,780
可憐的是 她做不到
Sadly, she can't.

82
00:03:13,780 --> 00:03:15,920
這就是彼得·潘人格的困境
Such is the plight of the Peter Pan personality.

83
00:03:16,389 --> 00:03:19,429
你是說海莉拒絕長大 我不相信
You're saying Haley refuses to grow up? I don't believe that.

84
00:03:19,429 --> 00:03:22,119
接著說到另一種類型 夢想家
Which brings us to another type, the Dreamer --

85
00:03:22,119 --> 00:03:25,369
白日做夢 總是很天真 很好騙
head in the clouds, tends to be naive, gullible.

86
00:03:25,369 --> 00:03:27,159
你現在變聰明了我真開心
I love that you're smart now.

87
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:30,240
這就是經典的比賽日早餐
That's your classic game-day breakfast --

88
00:03:30,259 --> 00:03:31,949
碳水 纖維 蛋白質
your carbs, fiber, your protein.

89
00:03:31,949 --> 00:03:33,349
要是再來一口白蘭地
You throw a shot of brandy in there,

90
00:03:33,349 --> 00:03:34,889
你就能參加67年的橄欖球全國錦標賽了
you'll be ready to play in the Ice Bowl.

91
00:03:34,889 --> 00:03:38,739
我不吃甜菜 過去不吃 今后也不吃
I don't eat beets. Never have, never will.

92
00:03:38,739 --> 00:03:41,089
你兩歲時連硬幣和蝴蝶都吃
When you were 2, you ate a dime and a butterfly.

93
00:03:41,089 --> 00:03:42,449
現在你的身體倒成圣殿了
Now your body is a temple?

94
00:03:42,449 --> 00:03:44,279
他可以在車上吃個蛋白質棒
He can eat a protein bar in the car.

95
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:47,320
我們還得去接住得遠的選手
We still have to pick up some players that live far away.

96
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,600
歌洛莉亞 這可不行
Gloria, this is not okay.

97
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,780
是合法的
It's legal.

98
00:03:49,819 --> 00:03:51,909
他家在這個區有郵政信箱
They have P.O. Boxes in the district.

99
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:54,340
再說 每個人都鉆空子
And besides, everybody bends the rules.

100
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:56,780
我發誓另外那隊的守門員
I swear the goalie from the other team

101
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:58,200
還當過我的滴滴司機 來接過我
has been my Uber driver.

102
00:03:58,299 --> 00:04:01,269
歌洛莉亞 我在想辦法讓這孩子吃蔬菜
Gloria, I'm trying to get the kid to eat his vegetables.

103
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,500
你得幫我一把
I could use a little support.

104
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:03,920
你怎么還沒換衣服
Why aren't you dressed?

105
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:06,460
你今天得給兩場比賽當裁判
You're supposed to referee two games today.

106
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,810
我告訴過你我不想當裁判
I told you I don't want to do that!

107
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:09,360
我今晚要看拳擊賽
I got my boxing match tonight.

108
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,730
再說 那些裁判制服傻死了
Besides, those ref outfits are stupid.

109
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:13,170
挺挺就過去了 沒事的
Walk it off. You're fine.

110
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,220
-快點 喬 -你沒聽出這話中的毛病了嗎
- Move it, Joe. - You're not hearing that?

111
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:20,740
海莉 跟我們說說艾麗克斯
So, Haley, you tell us about Alex.

112
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:23,760
和天才同住一間房可不容易
Well, it was not easy sharing a room with a genius.

113
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:26,120
她總是熬夜讀書 計算
She was always up reading and calculating,

114
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,220
但她也激勵了我
but she also inspired me.

115
00:04:28,220 --> 00:04:29,820
21歲時 我對自己說
When I turned 21, I said,

116
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:32,060
"海莉 你是時候做個獨立的女人了"
"Haley, time to be your own woman,"

117
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:33,760
于是我搬進了地下室
and I moved into the basement.

118
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,860
抱歉 我無意打斷
I'm sorry. I don't-I don't mean to interrupt,

119
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:37,950
但我不斷回想
but I just keep replaying

120
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:40,820
我就育兒方式問題給你的回答
my answer to you about my parenting style.

121
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:42,460
不必多想
Oh, don't give it a second thought.

122
00:04:42,460 --> 00:04:45,150
可當我說我想永不回頭地逃命去
But when I said I wanted to run away and never come back,

123
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:45,980
那只是個玩笑
that was a joke.

124
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,440
-當然 -我知道
- Yeah, absolutely. - I know.

125
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:49,220
只不過你很認真地記下來了
It's just that you wrote it down like --

126
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:50,770
-媽 別想了 -好
- Mom, let it go. - Okay.

127
00:04:50,770 --> 00:04:51,690
艾麗克斯
So, Alex,

128
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:54,260
我知道你夏天是在洪都拉斯過的
I see you spent your summer in Honduras.

129
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:56,240
你還進行過哪些激勵人心的旅行
Any other travel that inspired...

130
00:04:57,801 --> 00:04:58,691
鄧菲太太
Mrs. Dunphy?

131
00:04:58,691 --> 00:05:01,561
假如你能在我的笑話旁
If you could maybe just make a little, like, L-O-L

132
00:05:01,561 --> 00:05:03,971
小小寫上一筆"爆笑" 就很清楚了
next to my joke, so then it's super clear.

133
00:05:03,971 --> 00:05:05,811
澳大利亞 我去哥斯達黎加露營過
Australia, a camping trip to Costa Rica,

134
00:05:05,811 --> 00:05:07,801
-還在歐洲過了一個月 -很出眾
- and a month in Europe. - Excellent.

135
00:05:07,801 --> 00:05:10,481
她的確繼承了旅行癖的血統
Well, she does come by her wanderlust honestly.

136
00:05:10,481 --> 00:05:12,451
孩子們都知道我高中時的旅行
The kids here all know about my high school trip

137
00:05:12,451 --> 00:05:14,671
我去了蘇聯
to the Soviet Union.

138
00:05:14,671 --> 00:05:16,451
是 但是她不需要聽那些
Yeah, but she doesn't need to hear about that.

139
00:05:16,451 --> 00:05:18,701
-別 請講 繼續 -在冷戰膠著時期
- No, please. Continue. - In the depths of the Cold War,

140
00:05:18,701 --> 00:05:21,131
我的蹦床隊參與了文化交流活動
my tumbling team was part of a cultural exchange.

141
00:05:21,131 --> 00:05:23,431
我和一個叫塞奇的蹦床家成為了朋友
I became friends with a Russian tumbler named Sergei

142
00:05:23,431 --> 00:05:25,361
他想了解美國的一切
who wanted to hear all about the U.S.

143
00:05:25,361 --> 00:05:27,711
他讓我回家后給他發照片
He asked me to -- to send pictures when I got home,

144
00:05:27,711 --> 00:05:29,151
而且不是景點那種
and not just touristy stuff.

145
00:05:29,151 --> 00:05:31,221
塞奇對日常的東西很感興趣
Sergei was interested in ordinary things --

146
00:05:31,431 --> 00:05:34,261
機場啦 發電廠啦 火車站啦
uh, airports, um, power plants, train stations.

147
00:05:34,261 --> 00:05:35,921
他們家是做柵欄[防御]生意的
His family was in the fence business.

148
00:05:35,921 --> 00:05:39,101
他說我們的軍隊有全世界
He said our military had the best fencing...

149
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:40,380
最優秀的防護
...in the world.

150
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:43,240
我一定有給他發起碼50張
I must have sent him 50 pictures

151
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,880
彭德爾頓軍營的周邊圖
of the perimeter of Camp Pendleton.

152
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:48,620
總之 我們不想占用您一整天的時間
Anyway, we don't want to take up your whole day.

153
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:50,460
不然您就沒空詳細寫好報告了
You wouldn't have time to write up your report,

154
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:52,400
您可以把報告的標題寫成"艾麗克斯·鄧菲
which you could title "Alex Dunphy:

155
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,660
出淤泥而不染的那朵蓮花"
The Apple that fell very far from the Tree."

156
00:05:55,132 --> 00:05:57,542
-非常感謝你們 我們會保持聯系的 -謝謝您
-Thank you all very much. We will be in touch. -Thank you.

157
00:05:57,542 --> 00:05:58,462
-謝謝 -好 再見
-Thank you. -Okay, bye-bye.

158
00:05:58,462 --> 00:05:59,723
再見 聊得很愉快
Bye. Fun chatting.

159
00:05:59,812 --> 00:06:01,782
知道嗎 我們鄧菲家只要想
You know what? We Dunphys clean up

160
00:06:01,782 --> 00:06:03,762
就沒有做不好的事 對吧
pretty well when we want to, don't we?

161
00:06:03,762 --> 00:06:05,182
你在搞笑嗎
Are you kidding me?

162
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:08,760
媽 你就非得對她的筆記本犯強迫癥嗎
Mom, did you really have to OCD all over her notebook?

163
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,460
還有你 吹噓自己這么大還賴在家里住
And you, bragging about

164
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:12,660
都多大了 快30了吧
still living at home at, like, what? 30?

165
00:06:12,660 --> 00:06:15,220
還有爸你 真是干得漂亮
And Dad, well done.

166
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:17,340
沒有什么比得上自己老爹是個俄羅斯間諜
There's nothing that cinches a government job

167
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:19,320
更能把握住政府工作的機會了
like finding out your dad was a Russian spy!

168
00:06:19,322 --> 00:06:20,642
盧克說得太對了
Luke was right about all of you.

169
00:06:20,642 --> 00:06:23,482
指揮官 彼得潘 夢想家
Commandant, Peter Pan, Dreamer.

170
00:06:23,482 --> 00:06:25,402
謝謝 亞歷山德拉 在這個家里
Thank you, Alexandra. It's not easy

171
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:27,140
當個聰明人可不容易
being the smart ones in this family.

172
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:28,820
別拿你跟我比
Don't compare us!

173
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:30,600
你上一次的英語論文拿回來的時候
Your last English paper came back

174
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:33,180
貼了個"加油"加菲貓貼紙
with a Garfield sticker on it that said "Way to go!"

175
00:06:33,180 --> 00:06:35,540
那是她給的第二好的貼紙了
That's the second highest sticker she gives out!

176
00:06:41,180 --> 00:06:43,900
又一個新鮮雞蛋 下蛋公主的恩賜
Another fresh one, courtesy of Princess Layer.

177
00:06:43,983 --> 00:06:44,943
又取一個新名字
Another new name?

178
00:06:44,943 --> 00:06:47,123
她已經當過蛋格·萊恩和麻辣雞了
She's already been Egg Ryan and Chicky Minaj.

179
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:49,260
我知道擁有一只雞不是你的夢想
I know having a chicken isn't your dream.

180
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,760
但是如果這能讓你好受一些的話
But if it makes you feel any better,

181
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,760
我覺得我重新發現了自己
I think I know who I am again.

182
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:55,680
是一個討厭雞的人
A person who hates chickens!

183
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:58,380
它們又臟又蠢得要死
They are filthy and beyond stupid.

184
00:06:59,483 --> 00:07:00,553
等我一找到發票
The momennt I can find the receipt,

185
00:07:00,553 --> 00:07:01,813
就要退回這只雞
I am returning that chicken.

186
00:07:01,813 --> 00:07:02,953
但是我不打算告訴米奇爾
But I'm not gonna let Mitchell know because,

187
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,520
因為就像那只麻煩鳥 我也是個惹事精
like that vile bird, I made a big stink.

188
00:07:06,923 --> 00:07:09,053
我們又沒有雞食了
Oh. We're out of chicken feed again?

189
00:07:09,053 --> 00:07:10,453
今天我學校有個
I have a meeting at the school today

190
00:07:10,453 --> 00:07:11,783
和返校日委員會的會議
with the homecoming committee.

191
00:07:11,783 --> 00:07:13,003
如果投票沒錯的話
If polling is correct,

192
00:07:13,003 --> 00:07:14,553
新的皇后是坐輪椅的女孩
the new queen is gonna be in a wheelchair,

193
00:07:14,553 --> 00:07:16,033
放氣球的環節超支 沒預算弄殘疾坡道了
and we already blew our ramp budget

194
00:07:16,033 --> 00:07:18,443
所以能不能麻煩你去...
on a balloon drop, so could you maybe --

195
00:07:18,443 --> 00:07:19,803
小卡 這是我這周第三次
Cam, this will be my third trip

196
00:07:19,803 --> 00:07:21,723
去谷物飼料店了
to the feed and grain store this week.

197
00:07:21,723 --> 00:07:22,993
我們說好了
We agreed that you'd be the one

198
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,500
由你來照顧這只討厭鬼
to take care of this awful thing.

199
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:28,980
我從未真正感覺到和動物有聯系
I've never really felt a connection to animals,

200
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:31,480
但是那只雞很特別
but there's just something about that chicken.

201
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:34,140
那深情的雙眼 緊張的小動作
The soulful eyes, the nervous movements,

202
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:36,380
頭頂上可愛的紅紅小雞冠
the cute little splash of red on top.

203
00:07:36,684 --> 00:07:38,284
她真是太可愛了
She's just likeable.

204
00:07:38,284 --> 00:07:40,494
另外 我超愛去那家飼料店
Plus, I love going to that feed store.

205
00:07:40,494 --> 00:07:43,634
我一走進那扇門 就跟他們成了一路人
T-The second I walk through the door, I'm one of them.

206
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,760
-您好啊 鮑比 -你好
- Howdy, Bobby. - Hey.

207
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:47,980
聞起來像下過雨
Smells like rain.

208
00:07:47,994 --> 00:07:49,324
你怎么這么快就又回來了
What are you doing back so soon?

209
00:07:49,324 --> 00:07:50,204
對 我告訴過你一次應該
Yeah, I told you you got to buy

210
00:07:50,204 --> 00:07:51,704
多買幾包飼料
more than one bag of feed at a time.

211
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,280
沒事 不麻煩
No, it's no bother.

212
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,480
沒事 從農田里出來透透氣挺好的
No, it's nice to get out of the field,

213
00:07:55,484 --> 00:07:57,934
還能遠離雞 群
away from the chicken...s.

214
00:07:59,434 --> 00:08:00,495
晚上猴啊
Evenin'.

215
00:08:01,954 --> 00:08:03,494
問題是我不能讓小卡知道
The problem is I can't let Cam know

216
00:08:03,494 --> 00:08:06,144
我很享受這種鄉紳生活
that I'm enjoying my new life as a gentleman farmer.

217
00:08:06,144 --> 00:08:08,094
我們倆整段戀情里
I-I've spent our whole relationship

218
00:08:08,094 --> 00:08:10,794
我都在試圖打壓他的鄉野氣質
trying to tamp down his farm-ness.

219
00:08:11,014 --> 00:08:12,344
他就差這點鼓勵
Ugh, it's all the encouragement he'd need

220
00:08:12,344 --> 00:08:15,594
就要舉家搬到密蘇里鄉下當"王老先生"[兒歌]了
to -- to move us to Missouri and go full Old MacDonald.

221
00:08:15,594 --> 00:08:17,375
咿呀咿呀不要喲
E-I-E-I-no.

222
00:08:20,095 --> 00:08:22,735
我沒給門上閂嗎 天啊
Did I leave that unlatched? Oh, God.

223
00:08:23,155 --> 00:08:25,480
雞妮弗 雞妮弗
Hennifer? Hennifer?!

224
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:29,685
你是雷德利嗎 我是一點鐘比賽的裁判
Hey, are you Ridley? I'm reffing the 1:00 game.

225
00:08:29,685 --> 00:08:32,755
我的熱狗代金券是比賽之前還是之后給
Hey, do I get my voucher for a hot dog before or after?

226
00:08:33,020 --> 00:08:34,780
你的哨子呢
Oh...Hey. You got your whistle?

227
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:36,360
靠 我忘帶了
Oh, damn. I forgot it.

228
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:39,160
遲到 還沒帶哨子 你對這比賽的尊敬在哪
Late and no whistle? Where's your respect for the game?

229
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:40,580
在某個橄欖球場上吧
On a football field somewhere.

230
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,540
-不然你借我你的 -你開什么玩笑
- Hey, what do you say I borrow yours? - Are you kidding?

231
00:08:42,715 --> 00:08:44,565
我剛因為接吻病而停了六周課
I just lost six weeks of school to mono.

232
00:08:44,565 --> 00:08:45,875
你負責第四區
You're on field 4.

233
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:49,040
行了 我們快點了事吧
All right. Let's get this over with.

234
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,900
你是我比賽的裁判嗎
You are the referee for my game?

235
00:08:50,935 --> 00:08:52,635
你對足球一點都不懂
You don't know anything about soccer.

236
00:08:52,635 --> 00:08:55,425
這話留著去跟逼我到這的女人說吧
Take that up with the lady who forced me into this.

237
00:08:55,585 --> 00:08:56,955
好了 紫隊 我們出發
Okay, purple, let's go!

238
00:08:56,955 --> 00:08:58,505
喬 芬恩 克萊德 前鋒
Joe, Finn, Clyde up front!

239
00:08:58,505 --> 00:09:00,425
盧卡斯 迪倫 查德 后衛
Lucas, Dylan, Chad in the back!

240
00:09:00,425 --> 00:09:02,275
伊斯特芬 守門
Estefan, in goal!

241
00:09:02,275 --> 00:09:04,085
我猜伊斯特芬是那個
I'm guessing that Estefan is the kid

242
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,560
住得大老遠的孩子
who lives out of the district?

243
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:07,500
他的腿毛比我都多
His legs are hairier than mine,

244
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:09,340
而且我覺得他戴了個婚戒
and I think he was wearing a wedding ring.

245
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:12,200
我們開始吧 新手
Let's get this party started, rookie.

246
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:17,900
好吧 你不吹哨他們不會開始的
Okay, they won't start unless you use the whistle.

247
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:19,920
吹哨 吹哨
Whistle! Whistle!

248
00:09:21,626 --> 00:09:23,566
克萊德 空檔 進球了
Clyde, it's open! Yes!

249
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,300
吹哨 不算分 紫隊越位
Whistle! No goal! Purple offside!

250
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:29,180
越位 你瞎了嗎
Offside? Are you blind?

251
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:32,100
他說的對 紅隊從球現在的位置罰球
He's right. Free kick for red right where the ball is.

252
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:34,960
對 紅隊從球現在的位置罰球
Yes, free kick for red right where the ball is.

253
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,260
預備 吹哨
And...whistle.

254
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:40,220
幾周以來第一次 歌洛莉亞得聽我的
For the first time in weeks, Gloria had to listen to me.

255
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:42,890
我說了算 雷德利這么說的
I was in charge. Ridley said so.

256
00:09:44,336 --> 00:09:45,437
得分 太棒了
Goal, yes!

257
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,180
教練 比分要太超前了
Coach, you're running up the score.

258
00:09:47,296 --> 00:09:48,996
你得換一個弱一點的隊員
You got to sub in some of your weaker players.

259
00:09:48,996 --> 00:09:51,396
那個戴著頸枕的孩子吧 這種一般都弱
How about this kid with the neck pillow? It's usually a tip-off.

260
00:09:51,396 --> 00:09:53,396
我不是在超前 我是在贏
I'm not running up the score. I'm winning.

261
00:09:53,396 --> 00:09:56,706
你要么換人 要么走人
You either make the substitution or you are leaving my field.

262
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,480
夠了 吹哨
That's it! Whistle!

263
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,560
你被驅逐出場了
You're out of here!

264
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,560
嚇不倒我
Doesn't frighten me.

265
00:10:05,917 --> 00:10:07,097
這樣呢
How about that?

266
00:10:07,097 --> 00:10:08,078
有點嚇人
A little bit.

267
00:10:10,527 --> 00:10:11,987
你好 海莉 什么事
Oh, hey, Haley. What's up?

268
00:10:11,987 --> 00:10:13,927
其實我有點生家里人的氣
I'm kind of mad at my family, actually.

269
00:10:13,927 --> 00:10:16,357
他們一直說我有彼得潘人格
They keep saying I have one of those Peter Pan personalities,

270
00:10:16,357 --> 00:10:18,027
所以 計劃有變
so, um, change of plans.

271
00:10:18,027 --> 00:10:19,397
我們去看戲劇 不看看馬戲團了
We're going to a play, not the circus.

272
00:10:19,397 --> 00:10:20,257
等等 什么
Wait, what?

273
00:10:20,257 --> 00:10:21,867
迪倫 別大驚小怪
Dylan, don't make a thing out of this.

274
00:10:21,867 --> 00:10:22,847
那頭大象不會記得你去年答應過
The elephant's not going to remember

275
00:10:22,847 --> 00:10:24,257
今年要去看他的
you promised to see him next year.

276
00:10:24,257 --> 00:10:27,657
不是 海莉我是聽不清 信號不好
No, Haley. I-I can't hear you. Bad reception.

277
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,680
我往前開一點
Let me move up.

278
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:33,800
艾麗克斯說對了嗎
Was Alex right?

279
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:37,120
我不知不覺中成了... 泄露機密的間諜嗎
Had I been an unwitting -- an unwitting spy?

280
00:10:37,627 --> 00:10:39,727
我甚至翻出以前旅行時俄羅斯報紙
I even dug out an old article they'd done on me

281
00:10:39,727 --> 00:10:41,737
刊登的關于我的舊文章
in a Russian newspaper during my trip.

282
00:10:41,737 --> 00:10:43,577
塞奇告訴我文章標題是
Sergei told me the headline said,

283
00:10:43,577 --> 00:10:45,617
《年輕雜技演員的友誼使命》
"Young Tumbler's Mission of Friendship."

284
00:10:45,617 --> 00:10:47,587
但用谷歌翻譯掃描翻出來的
A quick scan into Google Translate

285
00:10:47,587 --> 00:10:48,798
真正意思是
revealed the truth --

286
00:10:48,798 --> 00:10:51,948
《知名雜技演員譴責西方》
"Famous Tumbler Denounces the West."

287
00:10:52,098 --> 00:10:54,058
我需要呼吸新鮮空氣 讓腦子清醒清醒
I needed some fresh air to clear my head.

288
00:10:54,058 --> 00:10:55,568
我念高中時有那么好騙嗎
Had I been that big a dupe in high school?

289
00:10:55,580 --> 00:10:56,720
如果我真那么傻
And if so, what was stopping them

290
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,320
今天又有什么能阻止他們再次利用我
from trying to use me again today?

291
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,380
鄧菲先生
Hey, Mr. D!

292
00:11:08,748 --> 00:11:10,642
你好啊 哥們
Hey, hey, hey! What's up, buddy?!

293
00:11:10,642 --> 00:11:20,918
快把你逼瘋了 對吧 指揮官
Makes you crazy, doesn't it, Commandant?

294
00:11:20,918 --> 00:11:21,689
沒有
No.

295
00:11:21,818 --> 00:11:24,358
這么說你沒打算把椅子搬正
So you weren't about to straighten that chair?

296
00:11:24,358 --> 00:11:26,818
因為如果世間萬物不是井然有序
Because if the whole world isn't completely ordered,

297
00:11:26,828 --> 00:11:28,488
你就會感覺被萬蟻噬心
it feels like your skin is on fire?

298
00:11:28,488 --> 00:11:30,978
這真是不折不扣的空談[椅子]心理學
This is literally armchair psychology.

299
00:11:30,978 --> 00:11:34,538
盧克 你對我的評價很正確 我就是個夢想家
Luke, your label for me was spot on. I am a Dreamer.

300
00:11:34,538 --> 00:11:36,228
不 更糟 我是容易受騙的蠢材
No, worse, I'm a -- I'm a patsy,

301
00:11:36,228 --> 00:11:37,798
好傻好天真的呆瓜
a mark, a full-on sucker!

302
00:11:37,798 --> 00:11:39,889
菲爾 冷靜點 你才不是好騙的笨蛋
Phil, calm down. You're not a dupe.

303
00:11:39,980 --> 00:11:40,860
快坐下
Have a seat.

304
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:42,500
真可悲
Sad.

305
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:45,099
-大家好啊 -迪蘭 帽子不錯啊
- Hey, guys. - Hey, Dylan. Sweet lid.

306
00:11:45,099 --> 00:11:46,809
-多少錢買的 -不要錢
- What did it cost you? - Zilch.

307
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:49,300
有人扔了很多帽子在街對面的垃圾桶里
Someone threw a bunch of them in the trash across the street.

308
00:11:49,329 --> 00:11:50,789
海莉在樓下等你呢
So, uh, Haley's waiting for you downstairs.

309
00:11:50,789 --> 00:11:52,699
等等 我以前也有頂類似的巴拿馬草帽...
Hang on. I used to have a Panama that looked a little like --

310
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:53,660
還有我的軟呢帽
And my fedora!

311
00:11:54,299 --> 00:11:56,639
你之前騙我說要捐給"陽敏禿美組織"
You duped me into believing we were donating them to ISSBA,

312
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:58,289
其實是要把帽子都丟到垃圾堆
and you were just gonna throw them in the trash.

313
00:11:58,289 --> 00:12:00,089
但這舉動傷害的不只是我 克萊爾
But this doesn't just hurt me, Claire.

314
00:12:00,189 --> 00:12:01,479
還有那些"對陽光敏感的
What about the poor people at the Institute

315
00:12:01,479 --> 00:12:04,439
禿頭美國人協會"的成員...
for Sun-Sensitive Bald... Americans?

316
00:12:04,439 --> 00:12:06,159
對不起 我很抱歉 菲爾
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry, Phil.

317
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:07,939
只是那個女人要來采訪我們
It's just that woman was coming and the interview --

318
00:12:07,939 --> 00:12:09,399
家里到處雜亂無章
and there was all that clutter.

319
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,800
我有病 告訴他 盧克
I'm sick. Tell him, Luke.

320
00:12:11,819 --> 00:12:13,889
省省吧 克萊爾 你跟其他人都一樣
Save it, Claire. You think of me what everyone thinks of me.

321
00:12:13,889 --> 00:12:16,739
覺得我是個逢被騙必中招的死蠢
I'm a rube, a pigeon, a greenhorn.

322
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:19,160
好了 迪蘭 去換身衣服 把帽子摘了
Okay, Dylan. Let's get you changed and lose the hat.

323
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,500
阻擋別人視線很沒禮貌
It's rude to block people's views

324
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,000
畢竟我們下午要去...
where we'll be spending our afternoon...

325
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,640
大人才會去的劇院
at an adult theater.

326
00:12:26,149 --> 00:12:27,749
我們都知道
I mean, we all knew

327
00:12:27,749 --> 00:12:29,069
底下還有第三頂帽子的 對吧
there was gonna be a third one, right?

328
00:12:29,069 --> 00:12:30,640
-老子不知道 -好吧
- I didn't! - Okay.

329
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:35,160
-我一定是忘把門閂上了 -很有可能
- I must have left the latch open. - You probably did.

330
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:37,900
我...我知道那只雞對你有多重要
I -- I know how much that chicken means to you.

331
00:12:37,900 --> 00:12:38,420
非常重要
So much.

332
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:40,220
如今發生了如此悲痛的事
And now something this painful --

333
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:43,640
我都不知道以后還有沒有勇氣再養雞了
I-I don't think I could have a chicken again ever.

334
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:45,730
等等 有監控錄像
Wait, wait. T-The security camera.

335
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,800
我們可以查出到底發生了什么
We can -- We can find out exactly what happened.

336
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:49,800
對 我忘了有這個
Oh, yeah. I...forgot about that.

337
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,200
米奇爾 米奇爾 等等 等等
Mitchell, Mitchell, wait, wait.

338
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:53,540
你不習慣面對農場生活的殘酷現實
You're not used to the harsh realities of farm life.

339
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:55,580
這些動物 看起來都很可愛
All these animals -- they seem so sweet,

340
00:12:55,610 --> 00:12:58,540
但一旦表現出軟弱的一面 就會招來屠殺
but it's a bloodbath at the first sign of weakness,

341
00:12:58,780 --> 00:12:59,660
就像我們跟朋友吃飯時
like dinner with our friends

342
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,250
有一個人起身離席后 會發生腥風血雨
when one person gets up from the table.

343
00:13:01,250 --> 00:13:02,590
老天 好吧 你來看
Oh, my God. Okay, well, you -- you look

344
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,480
-然后告訴我發生了什么 -好
- and tell me what happened. - Okay.

345
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,780
等會告訴我 我離席后他們說了我什么壞話
And later, tell me what people say when I leave the table.

346
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,620
好了 暫時無事發生
Okay, well, nothing happening yet.

347
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:11,270
其實 我想親眼看看
Okay, you know, I want to see.

348
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:13,570
不不不 別
No. No, no, no. Don't.

349
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:15,540
不好 糟糕
Oh, no. Oh, no.

350
00:13:15,540 --> 00:13:17,450
-有東西進來后院了 -是什么
- Something's come into the backyard. - What?

351
00:13:17,450 --> 00:13:19,020
好像是只浣熊
I think it's a raccoon.

352
00:13:19,020 --> 00:13:23,101
-蒼天啊 場面好血腥 -天啊
- OhOh th-- Oh, the horror! - Oh, my God!

353
00:13:23,101 --> 00:13:24,521
不 不 她在反抗
No, no. No, she's fighting.

354
00:13:24,521 --> 00:13:26,331
她在反抗 米奇爾 拼盡全力
She's fighting, Mitchell, with every fiber...

355
00:13:26,331 --> 00:13:28,761
-沒錯 -憑借她不屈不撓的弱雞斗志
- That's right. - ...of her indomitable chicken-y spirit.

356
00:13:28,761 --> 00:13:31,011
結束了 老天
And it's over. Oh, gosh.

357
00:13:32,491 --> 00:13:34,271
阿布杜爾-賈巴爾主演的音樂劇《俄克拉荷馬》后
since a dinner theater production of "Oklahoma!"

358
00:13:34,271 --> 00:13:36,391
我看過的最殘忍的農場慘劇
starring Kareem Abdul-Jabbar.

359
00:13:36,391 --> 00:13:37,781
刪除
Delete. Hmm.

360
00:13:38,260 --> 00:13:39,260
尸體在哪
Where's the body?

361
00:13:40,251 --> 00:13:41,251
被拖走了
Um, dragged off.

362
00:13:41,251 --> 00:13:42,501
那她說不定還活著
Well, then she could still be alive!

363
00:13:42,501 --> 00:13:43,821
我們必須去找她
W-We have to look for her.

364
00:13:43,821 --> 00:13:45,681
拿上她最喜歡的尖叫玩具
Okay. G-Grab her favorite squeak toy.

365
00:13:45,681 --> 00:13:47,211
好吧 哪一個
Okay, well, which -- which one?

366
00:13:47,211 --> 00:13:49,031
松鼠·鄧波兒還是獅奧納多·迪卡普里奧
Squirrely Temple or Lionardo DiCaprio?

367
00:13:49,031 --> 00:13:50,781
怎么感覺你一點都不了解她
It's like you don't even know her.

368
00:13:51,561 --> 00:13:54,931
"絕望的酒鬼... 破碎的生活 破碎的夢想"
"Dead-end alcoholics...broken lives, and broken dreams..."

369
00:13:55,540 --> 00:13:57,340
完全沒提到蜘蛛俠
Nope, nothing about Spider-Man.

370
00:13:57,561 --> 00:13:59,401
來的一定是另外一個冰人 不是蜘蛛俠的朋友
Must be a different Iceman that cometh.

371
00:13:59,401 --> 00:14:01,281
沒關系 說不定也很好看
That's okay. It could still be good.

372
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:03,440
可是 迪蘭 你不能再盯著
But, Dylan, you have to stop looking

373
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,120
那邊的嘉年華了
at the carnival over there.

374
00:14:05,361 --> 00:14:07,791
抱歉 但如果我知道之后
I'm sorry, but it just might be easier to enjoy

375
00:14:07,791 --> 00:14:10,581
我們會"行"去那邊 "耍"碰碰車
this unsparing look at life's castoffs

376
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,180
我會更容易欣賞
if I knew that afterwards,

377
00:14:12,402 --> 00:14:13,902
這出描繪人生失敗者的
we were gonna walketh over there

378
00:14:13,902 --> 00:14:15,522
殘忍戲劇
and goeth to the bumper cars.

379
00:14:15,522 --> 00:14:17,342
我只是要你花...
I'm literally asking for only...

380
00:14:17,772 --> 00:14:19,162
四個半小時
4 1/2 hours?

381
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:22,080
我知道你想證明我們是成熟的大人
Look. I know you want to prove that we're mature adults,

382
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,500
但你看看排隊的人
but look at this line.

383
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:25,220
我們在這里就是年輕人
We are the young people here.

384
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:26,520
然而
Whereas...

385
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,620
在嘉年華那邊 我們就會是
At the carnival, we'd be, like,

386
00:14:28,642 --> 00:14:30,612
年紀最大的人
the oldest people there?

387
00:14:30,612 --> 00:14:32,432
我能提醒你 上次他們押送我們
May I remind you what they said to us last time

388
00:14:32,432 --> 00:14:34,292
離開球池時 說了什么嗎
when they escorted us out of the ball pit?

389
00:14:34,292 --> 00:14:37,472
"不好意思 這個娛樂設施不是給..."
"Excuse me, but this attraction really isn't for..."

390
00:14:37,540 --> 00:14:38,060
"成年人玩的"
"adults."

391
00:14:39,090 --> 00:14:41,302
-我的夫人 -我的迪蘭
- M'lady. - M'Dylan.

392
00:14:43,792 --> 00:14:45,202
好了 我們需要談談
Okay, we need to talk.

393
00:14:45,202 --> 00:14:46,672
我們當然得好好談一下
You bet we need to talk.

394
00:14:46,672 --> 00:14:48,582
我把你趕出比賽 是我過分了
I was out of bounds throwing you out of that game.

395
00:14:48,582 --> 00:14:51,182
你把我趕出比賽 當然過分了
You bet you were out of bounds throwing me out of that game.

396
00:14:51,182 --> 00:14:52,612
但一切都是我的錯 杰
But it was all my fault, Jay.

397
00:14:52,612 --> 00:14:54,932
一切當然都是我的錯 杰
You bet it was all my fault, Jay --

398
00:14:54,932 --> 00:14:56,752
別用兔八哥那招陷害我重復你說的話
Don't Bugs Bunny me.

399
00:14:57,140 --> 00:14:59,120
好吧 我們都喜歡當掌控全局的人
Okay. So we both like to be in charge.

400
00:14:59,352 --> 00:15:01,803
但關系到喬時 我們能不能立場一致
But when it comes to Joe, can we both be on the same page?

401
00:15:01,803 --> 00:15:03,253
比如今早我試著勸他
Like this morning when I was trying to get him

402
00:15:03,253 --> 00:15:05,463
吃蔬菜時 支持我一下
to eat his vegetables? Back me up.

403
00:15:06,123 --> 00:15:08,213
我就知道我該扔了那些甜菜根
I knew I should have thrown away those beets!

404
00:15:08,213 --> 00:15:09,973
太蠢了 我是4歲小屁孩嗎
Stupid. What am I, 4?

405
00:15:10,233 --> 00:15:13,173
我們好像是沒能樹立起正確的榜樣
I guess we're not setting a very good example.

406
00:15:13,173 --> 00:15:15,143
沒錯 我們對對方說不
Exactly! When we say no to each other,

407
00:15:15,143 --> 00:15:16,883
他就認為他可以對我們說不
he thinks he can say no to us.

408
00:15:16,883 --> 00:15:18,973
對 比如他的功課 上床睡覺時間
Yeah, like for his homework, his bedtime --

409
00:15:18,973 --> 00:15:21,303
或者重要的事 例如吃有營養的食物
Or something important like eating those nutritious...

410
00:15:22,863 --> 00:15:24,173
-吹哨 -吹哨
- Whistle! - Whistle!

411
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:26,860
菲爾
Phil, look.

412
00:15:26,863 --> 00:15:28,913
帽子的事我騙了你 很抱歉
I'm really sorry I lied to you about the hats.

413
00:15:28,913 --> 00:15:30,773
但憑良心說 你的確是會...
But in all fairness, you do have a tendency to --

414
00:15:30,773 --> 00:15:33,253
又來了 又要說我舍不得丟東西嗎
This again? How I can't throw anything away?

415
00:15:33,323 --> 00:15:36,613
我們家有錄了100集的《囤積狂》節目
We have 100 episodes of "Hoarders" on DVR

416
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:37,960
你想看隨時都能看
in case you want to watch them again.

417
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,160
我的重點不在這里
That's not what this is about.

418
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:40,680
是無論誰跟我說什么
This is about me blindly believing

419
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:42,240
我都會盲目相信
whatever anybody tells me.

420
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:44,240
你這樣太苛責自己了
You're being too hard on yourself.

421
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,260
你總想看到人最好的一面
You want to see the best in people.

422
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:48,200
并不代表你就真的什么鬼話都會信啊
It doesn't mean you're gonna believe just anything.

423
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,860
真的嗎 那你說說我們珍愛的傳家寶
Really? What about our beloved family heirloom?

424
00:15:50,873 --> 00:15:51,883
-克萊爾 -怎么
- Claire? - Hmm?

425
00:15:51,900 --> 00:15:54,840
這是真貨嗎 還是我只是第四代的鄧菲傻子
Is this real, or am I just a fourth-generation Dunphy dummy?

426
00:15:55,654 --> 00:15:59,524
米奇的肩膀的確有些過壯
Well, uh, Mickey's shoulders are a bit muscular.

427
00:15:59,524 --> 00:16:02,184
但或許是迪士尼的創辦人
But, perhaps, Walt customized it

428
00:16:02,184 --> 00:16:04,284
為你的曾祖父所特別設計的版本嘛
for your great-grandfather because he was, uh --

429
00:16:04,454 --> 00:16:05,674
他是個港口工人是嗎
He was a longshoreman?

430
00:16:05,674 --> 00:16:07,244
他是女士帽子的商販
He sold ladies' bonnets. Oh.

431
00:16:07,284 --> 00:16:08,744
媽 你能把爸的信用卡
Mom, can you slip Dad's credit card

432
00:16:08,744 --> 00:16:10,085
在他發現之前塞回他...
back in his wallet before he --

433
00:16:10,824 --> 00:16:11,774
你好啊 帥哥
Oh. Hey, handsome.

434
00:16:11,774 --> 00:16:13,344
再次證明你們就是...
Further proof of how you all see me --

435
00:16:13,344 --> 00:16:14,954
把我當成腦子被門夾過的傻子
as a turnip truck faller-offer!

436
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,620
-才沒有 -那我問你
- No. - Then I'll ask you.

437
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:20,880
你相信這是華特·迪士尼先生畫的嗎
Do you believe that this was drawn by Walt Disney?

438
00:16:22,184 --> 00:16:23,694
艾麗克斯 你進來
Alex, get in here.

439
00:16:23,694 --> 00:16:25,604
-艾麗克斯 -別啊 親愛的 你知道她會說什么
- Alex! - No, honey, you know what she's gonna say.

440
00:16:25,604 --> 00:16:27,454
她的驗光師都不準她戴隱形眼鏡
Her optometrist won't even let her wear contacts

441
00:16:27,454 --> 00:16:29,954
因為她翻白眼過于頻繁... 你來啦
'cause of all the excessive eye rolling. - Hi.

442
00:16:30,100 --> 00:16:31,080
我想知道真相
I need to know the truth.

443
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:33,920
艾麗克斯 真貨還是假貨
Alex, real or unreal?

444
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:36,800
真貨
Real.

445
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:39,660
的確 是有些不像 但你不是說過
Yeah, it's a little off, but didn't you say

446
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:41,180
他當時得在卡車貨斗里畫嗎
he had to draw it in the back of a truck?

447
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:44,900
而且什么人搭便車會隨身攜帶繪圖鉛筆啊
And what hitchhiker would be carrying around a drafting pencil

448
00:16:44,915 --> 00:16:46,685
肯定是卡通繪畫師之類的嘛
if he wasn't some sort of an animator?

449
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:50,460
而且誰會沒油了淪落到道路一旁呢
And who would run out of gas on the side of the road

450
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:52,380
肯定是個滿眼光芒并幻想著
but a starry-eyed dreamer envisioning

451
00:16:52,380 --> 00:16:53,560
世界上最快樂之處的夢想家吧
the happiest place on earth?

452
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,700
所以 是真貨
So...real.

453
00:16:56,095 --> 00:16:57,455
另外 我得到那份工作了
Also I got the job.

454
00:16:57,455 --> 00:16:58,535
-什么 -很棒啊
- What? - Hey.

455
00:16:58,535 --> 00:17:00,865
是啊 他們剛打電話通知 我還在感到震驚呢
Yeah, they just called. I'm still in shock myself.

456
00:17:00,865 --> 00:17:02,605
親愛的 我好為你驕傲
Oh, honey. I'm so proud of you.

457
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,240
讓我去開一瓶香檳慶祝
Oh, let me get some champagne.

458
00:17:04,275 --> 00:17:05,645
盧克 來幫我拿杯子
Luke, help me with the glasses.

459
00:17:05,645 --> 00:17:08,435
艾麗克斯 太棒了 我就知道你能行
Alex, that's amazing. I knew you could do it.

460
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:09,720
你對所有事情都這么樂觀
You say that about everything.

461
00:17:09,775 --> 00:17:12,505
-是啦 但是... -不 我是想謝謝你
- Well, I know, but... - No, thank you.

462
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:16,180
學騎自行車 我的首次大提琴發表會
Riding a bike, my first cello concert,

463
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:18,210
大一化學課 這份工作
freshman chemistry, this job --

464
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:21,520
每次我確信自己做不到某件事的時候
every time I was sure I couldn't do something,

465
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:23,240
你都能讓我對自己有信心
you convinced me I could.

466
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,920
家里有一個愿意相信的人真好
It's nice to have a believer in the house.

467
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,840
到處都找不到她
I don't see her anywhere.

468
00:17:36,236 --> 00:17:38,466
轉個彎去那一邊找找吧
All right, let's maybe turn around and look over there?

469
00:17:38,466 --> 00:17:40,386
米奇爾 為什么雞要過馬路
Okay, Mitchell, why would the chicken cross the road?

470
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,780
我其實完全沒帶他在找雞
We were never finding that chicken.

471
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:45,120
在經過一陣不愉快的搏斗之后
After an unpleasant struggle that I only won

472
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:46,880
我在身中無數爪的情況下活了下來
after sustaining multiple scratches,

473
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,920
并把雞放到了我們車的后座上
I put it in the back seat of my car,

474
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,280
開車送到了一個產蛋場 把它丟進了圍欄
drove it to the egg farm, and lobbed it over the fence.

475
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:54,160
雞稍微能飛啦
They can fly a little.

476
00:17:54,536 --> 00:17:56,496
你的手臂上都是抓傷 怎么了
Oh, your arm's all scratched up. What happened?

477
00:17:56,496 --> 00:17:58,116
大概是我出手阻止
Oh, um, it's probably from when I was trying to

478
00:17:58,116 --> 00:18:00,946
兩只冠藍鴉的打架時留下來的吧
break that fight up with those, um -- those blue jays.

479
00:18:00,976 --> 00:18:02,446
哎喲 媽呀
Oh. Oh, gosh. Oh, God.

480
00:18:02,446 --> 00:18:03,436
我的老天啊
Oh, man.

481
00:18:03,436 --> 00:18:05,716
我突然感覺好困啊
I am all of a sudden feeling very tired.

482
00:18:05,716 --> 00:18:07,436
-需要換我來開車嗎 -不用 沒事的
- Well, do you want me to drive? - No, no, it's fine.

483
00:18:07,436 --> 00:18:09,086
-小卡 小心 -天啊
- Cam, watch out! - Oh, my God!

484
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:13,880
你把雞妮弗給丟了對吧
You got rid of Hennifer.

485
00:18:15,696 --> 00:18:16,656
對啦 我承認
Okay, I admit it.

486
00:18:16,656 --> 00:18:18,756
我討厭那只雞 我又沒臉
I hated that chicken, and I was too ashamed

487
00:18:18,756 --> 00:18:20,696
說出這件事 因為我為了你把我的
to say anything because I -- I made such a big stink

488
00:18:20,860 --> 00:18:22,920
鄉下魂給吐槽沒了的事 跟你抱怨那么久
out of you shaming the country out of me.

489
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,580
我也要道歉
I'm sorry.

490
00:18:23,580 --> 00:18:24,640
我想坦白一件事
I have a confession.

491
00:18:25,497 --> 00:18:27,107
-我愛那只雞 -真的嗎
- I love that chicken. - Really?

492
00:18:27,107 --> 00:18:29,457
我不想承認這件事 因為我想保持我自己
I-I didn't want to admit it because I like to see myself

493
00:18:29,457 --> 00:18:32,357
是那種... 你懂的 精致高雅的都市人
as a sort of, you know, sophisticated urbanite.

494
00:18:32,357 --> 00:18:33,617
但我想你...
But I guess you --

495
00:18:33,617 --> 00:18:35,017
你稍微把我鄉下化了一點
you countrified me a little.

496
00:18:35,017 --> 00:18:37,157
你也都市化了我
Well, you citified me.

497
00:18:37,307 --> 00:18:38,807
-好像有點甜呢 -是啊
- Aww, that's kind of sweet. - It is.

498
00:18:38,807 --> 00:18:40,387
我們現在只需要去找到一件活動
You know, now we just need to find an activity

499
00:18:40,387 --> 00:18:43,617
能滿足你心中那個叼稻草鄉村男孩
that satisfies the straw-chewing country boy in you

500
00:18:43,617 --> 00:18:46,997
與我心中那個喜愛櫥窗購物的都市男孩
and the window-shopping cosmopolitan in me.

501
00:18:48,967 --> 00:18:50,537
順著這條路往下開
Drive up the road a piece.

502
00:18:51,747 --> 00:18:53,757
問你啊 這馬用洗發水貓能用嗎
Now, will this horse shampoo harm a cat?

503
00:18:53,780 --> 00:18:55,240
因為我... 我好喜歡這香味
Because I just -- I love the scent.

504
00:18:56,057 --> 00:18:57,398
領子翻還是不翻
Collar up or down?

505
00:18:57,537 --> 00:18:58,708
翻下來
Uh, down.

506
00:19:03,537 --> 00:19:04,847
我會讓你嘗到報應的
You'll pay for that!

507
00:19:06,837 --> 00:19:08,117
天啊 天啊
Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

508
00:19:08,117 --> 00:19:10,347
暫停 暫停 我看到了自己的倒影
Timeout, timeout! I just saw my reflection!

509
00:19:10,347 --> 00:19:13,107
我就說那個西班牙糖棒會把我口紅弄沒
I told you that churro was going to drink up my lipstick.

510
00:19:13,407 --> 00:19:14,438
暫停結束
Time in!

511
00:19:14,878 --> 00:19:16,069
天啊
Oh, my God!

512
00:19:16,298 --> 00:19:18,898
迪蘭 口紅斷進我鼻孔了
Dylan, the lipstick went up my nose!

513
00:19:18,898 --> 00:19:20,828
斷在里面深處啊
It's really jammed up there!

514
00:19:20,918 --> 00:19:23,788
好的 你別動 海莉
Oh, okay. Stay still, Haley.

515
00:19:23,788 --> 00:19:26,068
我... 我去從另一邊撞你
I'll -- I'll hit you from the other side.

516
00:19:27,628 --> 00:19:28,769
你要干嘛
What are you doing?

517
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:34,940
通知你們一下 X光顯示鼻梁沒斷
Just want to let you know, the x-ray shows no broken nose.

518
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:37,260
我猜你看出來我們有點幼稚了
I guess you figured out we were acting kind of childish.

519
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:38,860
還能玩的時候就要玩到最瘋嘛
Enjoy it while you can, right?

520
00:19:38,918 --> 00:19:42,138
對啊 誰說我們要拼命長大成人啊
Yeah. Who says we have to race into being adults?

521
00:19:42,138 --> 00:19:43,858
誰會不想享受無憂無慮的生活
Why wouldn't you want to enjoy a carefree life

522
00:19:43,900 --> 00:19:44,720
而且要越久越好呢
as long as you could?

523
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,420
至少到生孩子前都能這樣啊
At least until the baby comes.

524
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:47,960
那還有好多年呢 相信我
Oh, that's years away. Trust me.

525
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:51,380
其實我們在麻醉前都會先驗血
Actually, we always run a blood test before anesthesia.

526
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:52,800
你懷孕了
You're pregnant.

527
00:19:58,520 --> 00:20:02,480
我們可以在這里耗一整晚
We can be here all night.

528
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,260
我不能啊
I couldn't.

529
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:05,780
我要去小短家看拳賽 都遲到了
I was late to watch the fight at Shorty's.

530
00:20:05,780 --> 00:20:06,940
等我到的時候
By the time I got there,

531
00:20:06,949 --> 00:20:10,599
波蘭香腸好的部分肯定都被他們吃光了
the Polish sausage was gonna be down to those puckered end pieces.

532
00:20:15,829 --> 00:20:17,459
聽我說 我妥協了
Listen, I'll meet you halfway.

533
00:20:17,459 --> 00:20:18,749
當你媽沒在看的時候
When your mother's not looking,

534
00:20:18,749 --> 00:20:20,729
你吃甜菜根 我就吃甜菜根
you eat a beet, I eat a beet.

535
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:21,040
同意嗎
Deal?

536
00:20:24,249 --> 00:20:26,439
親愛的 我能喝點酒嗎
Mi amor, can I get some wine?

537
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:29,460
伊斯特芬的父親打電話來了
That was Estefan's father.

538
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:31,580
綠哥布林隊想挖角他
The Green Goblins are trying to recruit him.

539
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:33,260
我需要去一趟提款機
I need to stop by the ATM

540
00:20:33,439 --> 00:20:35,009
然后去他家坐坐
and then go to his house.

541
00:20:35,009 --> 00:20:36,529
你爸爸不注意的時候
When your daddy's not looking,

542
00:20:36,529 --> 00:20:38,649
我們就一人吃一塊甜菜根好嗎
let's split the beets, okay?

543
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:45,380
好吧 我決定要吃了
Fine. I'm ready to eat these,

544
00:20:45,429 --> 00:20:46,699
但我們能不能關燈
but can we turn off the lights

545
00:20:46,699 --> 00:20:48,879
我吃的時候不想看它們惡心的樣子
so I don't have to see how gross they are?

546
00:20:48,879 --> 00:20:50,369
-有道理 -好主意
- Makes sense. - Good idea.

547
00:20:53,769 --> 00:20:56,200
-太棒了 寶貝 -我的乖兒子啊
- Bravo, papi! - That's my guy!
